 data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=http://names.at&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462380090000&amp;usg=AOvVaw2nQ3QuVdT7EMD12joXEIUg\">names.at</a>(j);</div><div>    if(val!=&quot;Type 1&quot;){</div><div>      m2(j)= exp(m1.array()(j));</div><div>    }</div><div>  }</div><div>  </div><div>  Type nll = m2(0);</div><div>  </div><div>  return(nll); </div><div>  }</div></div><div><br></div><div>###############################</div><div><br></div><div>There are probably many other issues with my code as well - sorry!</div><div><br></div><div>Any help at all will be much appreciated!</div><div><br></div><div>Cheers</div><div>Sarah</div></div>\r\n\r\n<p></p>\r\n\r\n-- <br>\r\nTo post to this group, send email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">us...@tmb-project.org</a>. Before posting, please check the wiki and issuetracker at <a href=\"https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1792462380090000&amp;usg=AOvVaw1r3A1BAzGYRes_wL6CinCe\">https://github.com/kaskr/adcomp/</a>. Please try to create a simple repeatable example to go with your question (e.g issues 154, 134, 51). Use the issuetracker to report bugs.<br>\r\n--- <br>\r\nYou received this message because you are subscribed to the Google Groups &quot;TMB Users&quot; group.<br>\r\nTo unsubscribe from this group and stop receiving emails from it, send an email to <a href data-email-masked rel=\"nofollow\">tmb-users+...@googlegroups.com</a>.<br>\r\nTo view this discussion on the web visit <a href=\"https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/tmb-users/57b52bd0-7846-405a-8710-21e926c9025f%40googlegroups.com?utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=footer\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en-US&amp;q=https://groups.google.com/d/msgid/tmb-users/57b52bd0-7846-405a-8710-21e926c9025f%2540googlegroups.com?u